Given the following question and four candidate answers (A, B, C and D), choose the best answer.
Question: An aluminum ion has a charge of +3, and an oxide ion has a charge of -2. Which would be the product of a reaction between these two elements?
A. Al_{2}O
B. Al_{2}O_{3}
C. 2AlO_{3}
D. Al_{3}O_{2}
Respond with one of the four choices (A, B, C or D).
